(7476303, 1188205, 86447, '<td valign="top">Deadfall in the Teton looks like they''ve been neatly sawed at a 90 degree angle... many years ago.<br/> <br/> <br/> <br/>I think if you''d not shown those cuts... maybe moved the camera angle... this would be a winner for "fallen".</td>', 'Deadfall in the Teton looks like they''ve been neatly sawed at a 90 degree angle... many years ago.   I think if you''d not shown those cuts... maybe moved the camera angle... this would be a winner for "fallen".', '2016-09-29 22:14:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(7476305, 1187742, 86447, '<td valign="top">This is stunning<br/> <br/>Gorgeous! <br/> <br/>WOW!  WHAT an image!<br/> <br/>But... to me... nothing has fallen... yet.<br/> <br/>So... I don''t know if it meets the challenge topic.<br/> <br/>I''d have entered this genius specimen in Free Study, I think (and I''d have taken out that one white spec on the background... and the dark curve next to it).<br/> <br/>It''s very lovely.   I just LOVE the textures. and the details in all of the whites.  <br/> <br/>Hard to do.</td>', 'This is stunning Gorgeous!  WOW!  WHAT an image! But... to me... nothing has fallen... yet. So... I don''t know if it meets the challenge topic. I''d have entered this genius specimen in Free Study, I think (and I''d have taken out that one white spec on the background... and the dark curve next to it). It''s very lovely.   I just LOVE the textures. and the details in all of the whites.   Hard to do.', '2016-09-29 22:17:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(7476306, 1187983, 86447, '<td valign="top">Hmmm... does the "moment before the fall" display "fallen"?  <br/> <br/>I''m not thinking so.  <br/> <br/>I think it displays "upright".  <br/> <br/>But, this is gorgeous!!</td>', 'Hmmm... does the "moment before the fall" display "fallen"?   I''m not thinking so.   I think it displays "upright".   But, this is gorgeous!!', '2016-09-29 22:18:59.000000', NULL, 1),
