(7476570, 1188218, 12611, '<td valign="top">on first look, it is pretty banal, and will no doubt do horribly with the dpc illuminati. but upon second look, it is everything that we should love about photography, no conceits, not contrived, an honest picture of what you saw. 9</td>', 'on first look, it is pretty banal, and will no doubt do horribly with the dpc illuminati. but upon second look, it is everything that we should love about photography, no conceits, not contrived, an honest picture of what you saw. 9', '2016-10-02 11:51:21.000000', NULL, 1),
