(7476639, 1188094, 103142, '<td valign="top">Intriguing... I almost want this one letterboxed, because everything is interesting except the foreground. If there wasn''t so many things to discover (like the shadow on the right chair, which I''m adoring), then the lack of interest could have given a resting spot But since I was finding a lot in other places, I wanted something more interesting than just the parking lines.<br/> <br/>Rambling comment.<br/> <br/>-7-</td>', 'Intriguing... I almost want this one letterboxed, because everything is interesting except the foreground. If there wasn''t so many things to discover (like the shadow on the right chair, which I''m adoring), then the lack of interest could have given a resting spot But since I was finding a lot in other places, I wanted something more interesting than just the parking lines. Rambling comment. -7-', '2016-10-02 19:33:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(7476640, 1188249, 103142, '<td valign="top">It''s a great view point and an interesting tree, but it seems underexposed to me. I think it could be more interesting a bit brighter so it really sang.</td>', 'It''s a great view point and an interesting tree, but it seems underexposed to me. I think it could be more interesting a bit brighter so it really sang.', '2016-10-02 19:34:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(7476641, 1188232, 103142, '<td valign="top">Lovely depth of field. I love the sharpness on the nuts, but I wish you would have backed off on the sharpening of the background so that it was soft and not quite as grainy. It would have made the nuts sing! -7- as is.</td>', 'Lovely depth of field. I love the sharpness on the nuts, but I wish you would have backed off on the sharpening of the background so that it was soft and not quite as grainy. It would have made the nuts sing! -7- as is.', '2016-10-02 19:36:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(7476642, 1188247, 103142, '<td valign="top">The horizon seems a bit tilted, but just enough to make it feel a little off. I''d rather have it straight or more tilted. I also find myself wondering what it would look like from in the street. But I don''t recommend getting run over -- that doesn''t feel too good...! <br/> <br/>good story<br/> <br/>-6-</td>', 'The horizon seems a bit tilted, but just enough to make it feel a little off. I''d rather have it straight or more tilted. I also find myself wondering what it would look like from in the street. But I don''t recommend getting run over -- that doesn''t feel too good...!  good story -6-', '2016-10-02 19:37:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(7476644, 1187949, 103142, '<td valign="top">Can figure out if I''m liking the high contrast or not. It seems a little artificial... I think...? It''s stunning on the face, but the rest being so dark doesn''t seem quite right. Did you darken the foreground quite a bit? Or is it the way it was shot? -7- for initial impact.</td>', 'Can figure out if I''m liking the high contrast or not. It seems a little artificial... I think...? It''s stunning on the face, but the rest being so dark doesn''t seem quite right. Did you darken the foreground quite a bit? Or is it the way it was shot? -7- for initial impact.', '2016-10-02 19:39:22.000000', NULL, 1),
