(7477330, 1188224, 97905, '<td valign="top">thanks for your feedback! this shot indeed does not fit 100% the theme, but hey, worth a try. The rating is more than fair so I can''t complain ;)<br/> <br/>Indeed, the picture is rather simple in the composition - it was taken through a grid of a heavy machine, but 2.8 may have been too much and the bokeh completely disappeared, leaving behind only a vague blur on the wall behind....<br/> <br/>I liked the character and the odd scene, away from the crowd....<br/> <br/></td>', 'thanks for your feedback! this shot indeed does not fit 100% the theme, but hey, worth a try. The rating is more than fair so I can''t complain ;) Indeed, the picture is rather simple in the composition - it was taken through a grid of a heavy machine, but 2.8 may have been too much and the bokeh completely disappeared, leaving behind only a vague blur on the wall behind.... I liked the character and the odd scene, away from the crowd.... ', '2016-10-06 12:07:03.000000', NULL, 0),
