(7477483, 1188094, 98565, '<td valign="top">This is indeed a picture where the viewer can spend more than a moment. I doubt that all of the voters even read the Armani sign. Love the ambiguity.<br/>And these aren''t parking lines at the forgroud, right? Seems like some metal pieces in a wooden deck</td>', 'This is indeed a picture where the viewer can spend more than a moment. I doubt that all of the voters even read the Armani sign. Love the ambiguity.And these aren''t parking lines at the forgroud, right? Seems like some metal pieces in a wooden deck', '2016-10-07 03:13:27.000000', NULL, 0),
